# 6.88g hero abilities, batch 01 of 12. Heroes: abaddon, broodmother, drow_ranger, huskar, lycan, nevermore, pugna, skeleton_king, treant, winter_wyvern.
# 6.88g hero abilities for units_heroes.osd (drain-b-1). Source: reference map 6.88g, the heroAbilList of each hero unit (unit.ini)
# and its AbilityData row (abilities_688g_perlevel.tsv). Cooldown is level-1 ticks (seconds x 16) and energy is level-1 mana.
# Attribute Bonus (A0NR) is skipped: the pack carries hero attributes in attr_rules.txt. Effects are empty: UNVERIFIED, because 6.88g
# Data fields are not mapped to engine effects (abilities_688g_perlevel.tsv header). Each is a learnable name with no effect yet.
# Rows below are the 6.88g learnable names moved from abilities.osd unchanged (cooldown and energy at level 1 from the
# archive). Effects are empty until the batch fills them. Each hero's slot order is its line in units_heroes.osd.
# to fill (no 6.88g ability rows yet): abaddon
# broodmother 6.88g A0WQ Insatiable Hunger
# Effect mapping (content-688g-ability-effect-mapping, drain-688g-effects-1): 16 rows, 0 mapped, 16 UNVERIFIED with effects empty.
# Why 0 mapped: abilities_688g_perlevel.tsv gives no effect kind for any label and no legend for its numeric target codes (目标类型), which an effect needs with its ability target. perlevel.tsv:7-9 says applying an ability needs its effect encoding.
